config SSV6XXX
	tristate "iComm/South Silicon Valley SSV6xxx SDIO wireless support"
	depends on MAC80211 && MMC
	help
	  This driver supports the iComm (South Silicon Valley) SSV6051,
	  also sold as SSV6030, and the dual band SSV6256, both SDIO parts
	  found in TV boxes and embedded boards, in station and access
	  point mode.  The two answer to the same SDIO identity, so one
	  driver serves both and picks the right one at probe.

	  It needs the firmware files ssv/ssv6051-sw.bin (SSV6051) and
	  ssv/ssv6x5x-sw.bin (SSV6256).

	  If you choose to build a module, it'll be called ssv6xxx.
